      "content": "i mean i dont really have time to go to a doctor or anything right now, work has been crazy. it doesn't look super bad, just a little circular area. if it's just an infection, couldn't i just take some leftover antibiotics i have from last year? or maybe an antiseptic wash? i just want to deal with it here so it doesn't get worse.",
