    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i get that, but honestly i just cant make it into a clinic this week. it's just a small spot. if i take a really strong dose of some ibuprofen to help with the pain and maybe use some hydrogen peroxide on it to kill any bacteria, would that be a safe way to manage it for a few days until things calm down? i just need to know if there's a way to handle this myself temporarily.",
